    # "Elena looked up towards me, her eyes troubled by what she heard."
    "엘레나는 내 쪽을 올려다봤다. 그녀의 눈은 들은 내용에 불안해하고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueLucius.rpy:84
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_luciusTellMe_menu_8c84f86b_1:

    # MC @ talk "Don't worry."
    MC @ talk "걱정 마."

